  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 2103.09 Suspension of Exceptions. In the event of documented animal health risks, Agr 2103.07 and Agr 2103.08 shall be suspended by written order of the commissioner.\n\nSource. #10975, eff 11-19-15; ss by #14564, eff 4-23-26, EXPIRES: 4-23-36",
